<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I would like to personally congratulate you on your acceptance into the New College of Interdisciplinary Arts and Sciences! &nbsp;I am the Academic Success Coordinator for your program and, along with your program faculty, am here to help you navigate your program.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Additionally, as you prepare for your new semester, please review your individual&nbsp;<a href="https://newcollege.asu.edu/advising/graduate" target="_blank">Graduate Program Website</a><font>&nbsp;including the Program Handbook and&nbsp;</font><a href="https://graduate.asu.edu/policies-procedures" target="_blank">Graduate Policies and Procedures</a>.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I look forward to meeting you at orientation. For more information about registration, orientation and the acceptance form, please&nbsp;<a href="https://newcollege.asu.edu/graduate/admission-next-steps" target="_blank">click here</a>.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div><font face="Arial, sans-serif">Please do not hesitate to contact me with any additional questions at&nbsp;</font><a href="mailto:ncgradadvising@asu.edu?Subject=Questions" target="_top" style="font-size: 12pt;">ncgradadvising@asu.edu</a>.</div>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Best,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Jan Lacey</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Academic Success Coordinator</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Arizona State University</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">New College, Graduate Studies M/C 1251</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">4701 W. Thunderbird Rd.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Glendale, AZ &nbsp;85306-4908</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">(602) 543-6266</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">(602) 543-4565 (Fax)</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="mailto:ncgradadvising@asu.edu?Subject=Questions" target="_top">ncgradadvising@asu.edu</a></div><div style="font-family: arial;"><font color="#cccccc" size="1"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" color="#cccccc" size="1">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>